,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302229577,"modifiedTime":1687302229577,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"r4C5MAlqGow6HEkt"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>20 feet. @Check[type:will|dc:26]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":20,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302293567,"modifiedTime":1691129222189,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"GRL90SbjvFV4XNaQ"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Sunlight Powerlessness","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A cloaked cadaver caught in sunlight is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Slowed]{Slowed 2} for as long as it remains in the sunlight.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Cf7CivgeQB02Ds9c","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302372901,"modifiedTime":1687302390478,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Touch of Paralysis","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse","magical"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"nLVx46NjPSel7ny0":{"damage":"2d6+10","damageType":"void"}},"bonus":{"value":23},"attackEffects":{"value":["paralysis"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"YKqtcPSUj8ukt8DL","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302400105,"modifiedTime":1721535133522,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Cloaked Embrace","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An adjacent living creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Paralyzed]{Paralyzed}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The cloaked cadaver drains the vital essences of the creature, which must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:29] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Drained]{Drained 1}, and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[12d6[void]] damage, is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Drained]{Drained 2}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Doomed]{Doomed 2}, and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature takes [[/r 24d6[void]]] damage.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"tx0qVhcTqB4iflYp","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302409349,"modifiedTime":1691261014157,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Soul's Anguish","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A living creature dies within 20 feet of the cloaked cadaver</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The cloaked cadaver absorbs the creature's soul and regains a number of Hit Points equal to the creature's level as it begins to feed off of it. A creature whose soul has been absorbed in this way can't be resurrected unless the cloaked cadaver is killed within 7 days. If the cloaked cadaver isn't killed within 7 days the creature's soul is completely consumed and can only be restored to life by a powerful effect such as <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.YfJTXyVGzLhM6V8U]{Miracle}</em> or <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.6dDtGIUerazSHIOu]{Wish}</em>.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["death","divine"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"IthAV7GmUl9NhuTK","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687302411389,"modifiedTime":1687302615075,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Paralysis","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Any living creature hit by a cloaked cadaver's attack must succeed at a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:26] save or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Paralyzed]{Paralyzed}. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 after each failed save.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","incapacitation"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"dvgvBGsiHiI7HlOb","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},